title: "RadiaCode flight spectroscopy"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Fisicas/radiacode-flight-spectroscopy"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nelson"
    given-names: "Michael"
    email: "nelsondirect@gmail.com"
keywords:
  - gamma-ray spectroscopy
  - RadiaCode
  - aviation
  - reproducible research
  - detector response
abstract: >-
  A data, methods, and derived-results snapshot for time-resolved RadiaCode
  gamma-ray spectroscopy during four commercial flights. It includes original
  detector files, calibration evidence, compact derived products, validation
  tools, and cautious detector-response interpretation. Third-party flight-track
  files are not redistributed. Non-raw FlightAware-derived products are
  displayed for noncommercial academic review and excluded from the repository's
  MIT and CC BY 4.0 licenses. The snapshot does not claim direct particle
  fluence, species identification, or calibrated dose.
